{
  "id": "staircase_calculator",
  "title": "Staircase Calculator",
  "description": "Calculate steps, unit rise and run in a staircase. This calculator can be used to calculate unit rise and run of straight stairs.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Staircase Calculator\n\nCalculate the unit rise and run for straight stairs.\n\n### General Guidelines\n- Unit run should not be less than **10 inches (25 cm)**\n- Unit rise should not exceed **7 3/4 inches (20 cm)**"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_rise",
          "label": "Total Rise",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 120
        },
        {
          "id": "total_run",
          "label": "Total Run",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 120
        },
        {
          "id": "num_steps",
          "label": "Number of Steps",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 13
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "unit_rise",
          "label": "Unit Rise",
          "formula": "inputs.total_rise / inputs.num_steps",
          "unit": "inches",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "unit_run",
          "label": "Unit Run",
          "formula": "inputs.total_run / (inputs.num_steps - 1)",
          "unit": "inches",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}